      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] **Testing:** While `FpRateLimiter` and `FpTemplateId` have thorough boundary tests, there are no tests for the new `FpTemplateStore` logic and state transitions (e.g., verifying `consume_secret` timeouts, double-reads, and boundary expiration).\n\nPlease add test coverage for `FpTemplateStore` (you can append this snippet to this file):\n\n```cpp\nZTEST(fpsensor_utils, test_template_store_secret_lifecycle)\n{\n\tpositive_match_secret_state state{};\n\tFpTemplateStore::disable_secret(state);\n\tzassert_equal(state.template_matched, FP_NO_SUCH_TEMPLATE);\n\tzassert_false(state.readable);\n\tzassert_equal(state.deadline.val, 0);\n\n\tconst FpTimestamp t0{ std::chrono::seconds(10) };\n\tconst auto window \u003d FpTemplateStore::kSecretValidityWindow;\n\n\t// Enable secret\n\tzassert_true(FpTemplateStore::enable_secret(1, state, t0).has_value());\n\tzassert_equal(state.template_matched, 1);\n\tzassert_true(state.readable);\n\n\t// Enable while already readable fails and disables\n\tzassert_equal(FpTemplateStore::enable_secret(2, state, t0).error(), EC_ERROR_UNKNOWN);\n\tzassert_false(state.readable);\n\n\t// Consume unreadable secret fails\n\tzassert_equal(FpTemplateStore::consume_secret(state, std::nullopt, t0).error(), EC_RES_ACCESS_DENIED);\n\n\t// Re-enable and consume with mismatched expected_fgr\n\tzassert_true(FpTemplateStore::enable_secret(2, state, t0).has_value());\n\tzassert_equal(FpTemplateStore::consume_secret(state, *FpTemplateId::create(1), t0).error(), EC_RES_ACCESS_DENIED);\n\tzassert_false(state.readable);\n\n\t// Re-enable and consume at exactly the timeout (N boundary)\n\tzassert_true(FpTemplateStore::enable_secret(2, state, t0).has_value());\n\tzassert_equal(FpTemplateStore::consume_secret(state, std::nullopt, t0 + window).error(), EC_RES_TIMEOUT);\n\n\t// Re-enable and consume exactly before timeout (N-1 boundary)\n\tzassert_true(FpTemplateStore::enable_secret(2, state, t0).has_value());\n\tconst auto matched \u003d FpTemplateStore::consume_secret(state, std::nullopt, t0 + window - std::chrono::microseconds(1));\n\tzassert_true(matched.has_value());\n\tzassert_equal(matched-\u003eraw(), 2);\n}\n```\n[🔗](http://go/tj/d02eb2ee-a60a-4539-bf81-8656191e4735)",
